        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete the faction introduction to Friendly and buy its guaranteed reputation tabard.\n\n1. Check Kirin Tor reputation. If Friendly or higher, skip to step 3. Mages commonly start Friendly and can buy directly; other classes can obtain the tabard too.\n\n2. For Friendly, visit Librarian Donathan at Amber Ledge in Borean Tundra (45.2, 33.4). Start Prison Break: kill Beryl Mage Hunters in the camp just south of the ledge, loot a Beryl Prison Key and open an arcane prison to rescue a mage. Return to Donathan, then follow Abduction and the Amber Ledge investigation chain. For Abduction, weaken the target before using the provided capture item; high-level characters can use Soft Foam Sword on an eligible target to avoid killing it. Keep completing the Kirin Tor follow-ups until Friendly. Many Coldarra red-dragon quests award Wyrmrest instead, so check the reward faction.\n\n3. Go to the original Dalaran above Crystalsong Forest. Enter the Violet Citadel on the west side and climb the interior stairs. Archmage Alvareaux stands upstairs around 25.4, 47.8.\n\n4. At Friendly, buy Tabard of the Kirin Tor for up to 1 gold and equip it. If the shop says you already own a unique item, check bags and bank before trying another copy.\n\n5. For optional reputation, wear the actual tabard and clear Heroic Halls of Lightning in the Storm Peaks (45.4, 21.4). Other original Wrath heroics work too. Normal Halls of Lightning is a repeatable alternative: leave, reset outside and respect the instance limit. Check the reputation bar before repeating runs.",
