        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Complete the cross-continent Loremaster quest metas; this is an extensive account collection project.\n\n1. Search Achievements for The Loremaster (7520). Expand each unfinished continent/expansion requirement, then its unfinished zone achievements. List the missing story chapters instead of accepting every quest on every continent.\n\n2. Check existing characters before beginning. An alt with most of a zone finished can save substantial work. Completed zone achievements contribute to the account meta; inspect the actual chapter criteria before splitting an unfinished chain between characters.\n\n3. Enable Trivial Quests in tracking. Follow the missing zone's story markers and finish one chapter at a time. Take connected quests together, loot quest enemies for item-started follow-ups, and return to the last giver when a chain appears to stop.\n\n4. At high level, carry Soft Foam Sword for eligible enemies that must be weakened and kept alive. Remove damage-proc gear for capture, interrogation and vehicle objectives; a one-shot can prevent the required action.\n\n5. If a giver is absent, check your log for another stage or scenario affecting the zone and follow the chapter's current prerequisites. Do not hunt removed Battle for the Undercity objectives or use pre-Cataclysm quest-count lists as a Retail route.\n\n6. Recheck each zone achievement after its chapters, then the expansion achievement after its zones. Continue until every requirement currently listed under 7520 is complete. Northrend alone or a lifetime quest total does not award this tabard.\n\n7. Collect the mailed tabard. For missing mail or an alt's copy, speak to Elizabeth Ross in Northrend Dalaran (51.6, 55.4), Rebecca Laughlin in Stormwind (64.0, 77.2), or Garyl in Orgrimmar (47.5, 75.5). Choose the lost-Loremaster's-Colors dialogue, then equip it.",
